    471           *           Ki : integrator gain
    472           *
    473           *           Integrator in <b>fractional arithmetic</b>, <b>discrete time domain</b>:
    474           *
    475           *           \f[ y_f(k) =  y_f(k - 1) + T_s \cdot K_{i_{f}} \cdot x_f(k) \f]
    476           *           where:
    477           *           Ts : sampling period
    478           *
    479           *  @param[in]      integ_params    = integrator parameters: integrator gain and limits
    480           *  @param[in, out] y_k_1           = integrator output in Q2.30 notation  (input is at k-1 step, output is at k step)
