    498          /**
    499           *  @brief      PI Regulator with back-calculation anti-windup strategy
    500           *  @details    PI controller algorithm.
    501           *              Definitions:
    502           *
    503           *              <b>e(t)</b> - input error in continuous time domain.
    504           *
    505           *              <b>u(t)</b> - controller output in continuous time domain.
    506           *
    507           *              <b>e(k)</b> - input error at step k - discrete time domain.
    508           *
    509           *              <b>u(k)</b> - controller output at step k - discrete time domain.
